                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJ61cqhn-pQjQRJRhxopBkMOo/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25GWmRGbGFhMGxEZUdFMVRXeDVSWEpuWVhSM01sRRAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "3 months ago",
                        "rating":  4,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Double Single is an American-style restaurant serving fried chicken, fries, pizza, pasta, and more. The food is fantastic and very tasty, I’ve been here at least three times, which says a lot. The fried chicken is especially good, the pasta is solid, and the pizza is great once it arrives.\nThe only reason it’s not a full 5/5 for me is the waiting time. The pizza can take a long time to prepare, we waited around 40–50 minutes for our meal, and by then we were already extremely hungry. Because of that, I wouldn’t recommend coming here if you’re starving and need food quickly.\nThat said, if you’re not in a rush and don’t mind waiting, the quality of the food makes it worth it.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
